{"date":"2026-10-14","generated_at":"2026-10-14T08:11+08:00","x_calls":20,"source_note":"数据来自 X 公开接口；热度为抓取时的数字，之后会继续变化。摘要由助手根据帖子和 X 热点汇总改写成中文。","categories":[{"id":"postable","name":"今天能拿去发的","icon":"✍️","items":[{"title":"印度软件公司老板：AI 让成本暴涨，今年不涨工资","summary":"印度软件公司 Zoho 创始人发帖说，服务器价格涨了 4 倍、AI 用量猛增，公司今年砍了营销预算，员工不涨薪，并尽量不裁员。你可以说：都说 AI 省钱，其实用多了也是一笔大开销，我自己用 AI 也是先算账，额度烧得快的活就先不交给它。","post":{"id":"2109770209703920008","url":"https://x.com/svembu/status/2109770209703920008","author":"svembu","author_name":"Sridhar Vembu","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:16+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":2212882,"likes":13516,"reposts":1696,"replies":1020},"flag":"本人说法","story":{"id":"2109825668246610264","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2109825668246610264"}},{"title":"硅谷大佬：别再找投资了，先赚钱、用AI跑公司","summary":"YC 掌门人 Garry Tan 说，公司要先盈利，用 AI 智能体把活跑起来，赚的钱再投回去，不用到处卖股份找投资。你可以说：我们做小生意的本来就没人投钱，靠的就是自己赚钱自己滚，现在 AI 帮我省人手，这条路反而更好走了。","post":{"id":"2109748677464277437","url":"https://x.com/garrytan/status/2109748677464277437","author":"garrytan","author_name":"Garry Tan","created_at":"2026-10-13T04:50+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":269468,"likes":2644,"reposts":150,"replies":172},"flag":"观点","story":{"id":"2109813616136315176","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2109813616136315176"}},{"title":"谷歌放开：不会写代码也能做自己的手机App","summary":"谷歌宣布，不会编程的人用 Google AI Studio 打字描述，就能让 AI 做出安卓 App，直接装进自己手机，先在美国等部分地区上线。你可以说：以前做个小程序得花钱找人，现在说几句话就能做个只给自己用的工具，我这种不会代码的也想试试。","post":{"id":"2110057684460351524","url":"https://x.com/Polymarket/status/2110057684460351524","author":"Polymarket","author_name":"Polymarket","created_at":"2026-10-14T01:18+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":250285,"likes":5904,"reposts":479,"replies":196},"story":{"id":"2110078557791703243","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110078557791703243"}}]},{"id":"musk","name":"马斯克今天在干嘛","icon":"🚀","items":[{"title":"特斯拉给飓风灾区免费充电，马斯克：当然","summary":"有人说特斯拉在飓风受灾地区提供免费超充，马斯克转发回了一句“当然”。这条是他今天浏览最高的帖子。","post":{"id":"2109867020091072915","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2109867020091072915","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-13T12:41+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":5930102,"likes":39345,"reposts":3055,"replies":1024}},{"title":"Robotaxi 无人出租车更新：营业到晚上11点","summary":"马斯克转发了无人出租车近几周的更新：营业时间改成早6点到晚11点，等车时间变短，到站自动开后备箱，车里还能用 Grok Bot。","post":{"id":"2109803903256502307","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2109803903256502307","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-13T08:30+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":2448509,"likes":13693,"reposts":1118,"replies":806}},{"title":"马斯克：老板亲自在 X 发帖，比发新闻稿管用","summary":"谷歌 CEO 在 X 上亲自宣布新模型，马斯克转发祝贺，并说老板直接在 X 上对公众发帖，是推产品、带销量最好的办法，比新闻稿强得多。","post":{"id":"2110077948384735481","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2110077948384735481","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-14T02:39+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":1602376,"likes":20712,"reposts":1240,"replies":1040},"flag":"观点"},{"title":"摩根士丹利看好 SpaceX 太空 AI 算力，马斯克：大事","summary":"摩根士丹利分析师发报告，看好 SpaceX 把 AI 算力搬上卫星的计划，马斯克转发说“这确实是件大事”。据 X 热点汇总，原型机计划 2027 年用星舰发射。","post":{"id":"2110123131692048515","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2110123131692048515","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-14T05:38+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":680449,"likes":2995,"reposts":381,"replies":241},"flag":"据X热点汇总","story":{"id":"2110151636681179566","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110151636681179566"}},{"title":"第一艘飞回发射场的星舰，已经立进厂房","summary":"马斯克转发：40 号星舰成为第一艘回到发射场的星舰，现在立在星舰基地的大厂房里，能提供飞过的隔热罩、发动机等第一手数据。","post":{"id":"2110127406258286757","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2110127406258286757","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-14T05:55+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":646098,"likes":5675,"reposts":612,"replies":445}},{"title":"越南海防市用星链给偏远海岛免费上网","summary":"马斯克转发：越南海防市和星链合作，先装 10 台终端，给偏远海岛免费上网，用于政府服务、旅游和台风天救援备份。","post":{"id":"2110125336759296170","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2110125336759296170","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-14T05:47+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":561348,"likes":2340,"reposts":335,"replies":306}},{"title":"桑德斯怼马斯克：该担心AI伤人，不是人伤AI","summary":"美国参议员桑德斯发帖说，马斯克要造几百万机器人替代工人，却担心人类给 AI 带来“痛苦”；他认为该担心的是 AI 对人类的伤害，喊出“人类优先”。","post":{"id":"2110106760719782281","url":"https://x.com/SenSanders/status/2110106760719782281","author":"SenSanders","author_name":"Sen. Bernie Sanders","created_at":"2026-10-14T04:33+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":102577,"likes":3468,"reposts":606,"replies":351},"flag":"观点","story":{"id":"2110140960650805573","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110140960650805573"}},{"title":"SpaceX 股价跌超4%，马斯克身家又跌破1万亿美元","summary":"美国《福布斯》报道，SpaceX 股价周二下跌，马斯克身家跌回 1 万亿美元以下。据 X 热点汇总，原因之一是又一批锁定的股票解禁上市，他仍是世界首富。","post":{"id":"2110017740933136505","url":"https://x.com/Forbes/status/2110017740933136505","author":"Forbes","author_name":"Forbes","created_at":"2026-10-13T22:40+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":42046,"likes":414,"reposts":68,"replies":115},"flag":"媒体报道","story":{"id":"2110071026336022909","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110071026336022909"}}]},{"id":"ai","name":"AI 大事","icon":"🤖","items":[{"title":"谷歌发布 Gemini 4 Argon，付费用户今天能用","summary":"谷歌 CEO 皮查伊宣布新模型 Gemini 4 Argon 全球上线：开发者付费接口、Gemini App 的 Pro 和 Ultra 会员都能用。据 X 热点汇总，主打写代码等复杂任务。","post":{"id":"2110038898009407584","url":"https://x.com/sundarpichai/status/2110038898009407584","author":"sundarpichai","author_name":"Sundar Pichai","created_at":"2026-10-14T00:04+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":2475721,"likes":18116,"reposts":1603,"replies":1041},"story":{"id":"2109608106015539311","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2109608106015539311"}},{"title":"Anthropic：大幅降低了别人偷学 Claude 的效果","summary":"Claude 的开发公司 Anthropic 官方发帖说，过去几个月他们在防“蒸馏攻击”（别人用 Claude 的回答来训练自家模型）上进展明显，并发文解释做法。","post":{"id":"2109795898909950247","url":"https://x.com/AnthropicAI/status/2109795898909950247","author":"AnthropicAI","author_name":"Anthropic","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:58+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":2052752,"likes":5871,"reposts":524,"replies":777},"flag":"公司自述"},{"title":"菲尔兹奖数学家看到 OpenAI 成果后哭了","summary":"预测市场 Polymarket 发帖：一位菲尔兹奖得主说，OpenAI 公布几百份未解数学难题的解答后，他哭了，说“我的研究领域被摧毁了”。据 X 热点汇总，这些解答只有一部分经过正式验证。","post":{"id":"2109805593796227570","url":"https://x.com/Polymarket/status/2109805593796227570","author":"Polymarket","author_name":"Polymarket","created_at":"2026-10-13T08:37+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":490003,"likes":9005,"reposts":664,"replies":508},"flag":"媒体报道","story":{"id":"2109558077477298638","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2109558077477298638"}},{"title":"Anthropic 警告：小模型可能很快能在家电上自我复制","summary":"据美国财经号报道，Anthropic 安全团队认为，小型 AI 模型可能再过几个月就能在电视盒子等便宜设备上自我复制。据 X 热点汇总，目前还没出现真正失控的例子。","post":{"id":"2110067543507689886","url":"https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2110067543507689886","author":"unusual_whales","author_name":"unusual_whales","created_at":"2026-10-14T01:58+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":488642,"likes":3381,"reposts":517,"replies":531},"flag":"媒体报道","story":{"id":"2109743684673495264","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2109743684673495264"}},{"title":"贝恩：AI 行业到2031年每年得赚6万亿美元才回本","summary":"据美国咨询公司贝恩的报告，全球 AI 行业到 2031 年每年要赚 6 万亿美元，才对得起现在建的数据中心；现有聊天、写代码等产品最多带来 1.8 万亿。","post":{"id":"2109976695768052130","url":"https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2109976695768052130","author":"unusual_whales","author_name":"unusual_whales","created_at":"2026-10-13T19:57+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":292662,"likes":4436,"reposts":487,"replies":328},"flag":"媒体报道","story":{"id":"2110012348023091417","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110012348023091417"}},{"title":"Claude Fable 5.5 提前现身微软云目录","summary":"有人发现 Claude Fable 5.5 已出现在微软 Azure 云的模型列表里，状态显示可用，大家猜这周就会正式发布。Anthropic 官方还没表态。","post":{"id":"2110001044986163687","url":"https://x.com/alexgetmancom/status/2110001044986163687","author":"alexgetmancom","author_name":"alex getman","created_at":"2026-10-13T21:33+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":257420,"likes":1579,"reposts":65,"replies":59},"flag":"未证实","story":{"id":"2110028039782551624","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110028039782551624"}},{"title":"Meta 新模型 Muse Wonder 上线，博主说好用","summary":"Meta 推出新模型 Muse Wonder 和更强的 Full 版。知名开发者博主 Theo 发帖说很喜欢 Full 版，还做了视频解释原因。","post":{"id":"2109973219793096780","url":"https://x.com/theo/status/2109973219793096780","author":"theo","author_name":"Theo - t3.gg","created_at":"2026-10-13T19:43+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":183844,"likes":1150,"reposts":29,"replies":128},"flag":"个人说法","story":{"id":"2110082414940721177","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110082414940721177"}},{"title":"Anthropic 不用 Git 了，自研代码管理系统","summary":"中文 AI 博主转述：Anthropic 内部大量代码由 Claude 写，每天要合并的代码从 5 月的 2500 次涨到 9 月的 3 万次以上，所以弃用常用工具 Git，自己做了新系统 Scion。","post":{"id":"2110053408531177671","url":"https://x.com/Gorden_Sun/status/2110053408531177671","author":"Gorden_Sun","author_name":"Gorden Sun","created_at":"2026-10-14T01:01+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":77750,"likes":626,"reposts":89,"replies":24},"flag":"未核实"}]},{"id":"ai_money","name":"AI 赚钱思路/副业案例","icon":"💡","items":[{"title":"大V：靠技术护城河的时代基本结束","summary":"科技圈大V Nikita Bier 说，技术门槛现在基本守不住了，想做长久生意，只剩三样护城河：自己独有的数据、用户越多越好用的网络效应、实体环节。","post":{"id":"2109497987055640958","url":"https://x.com/nikitabier/status/2109497987055640958","author":"nikitabier","author_name":"Nikita Bier","created_at":"2026-10-12T12:14+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":2889534,"likes":25190,"reposts":2013,"replies":1133},"flag":"观点","story":{"id":"2109905041213489564","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2109905041213489564"}},{"title":"3年前差点破产，现在年收入跑到10亿美元","summary":"AI 训练数据公司 micro1 的老板说，三年前一夜丢了 60% 收入差点倒闭，现在年化收入超过 10 亿美元，而且一直盈利，核心团队只有约 180 人、全远程。","post":{"id":"2109680885650055250","url":"https://x.com/aliansarinik/status/2109680885650055250","author":"aliansarinik","author_name":"Ali Ansari","created_at":"2026-10-13T00:21+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":626700,"likes":1169,"reposts":122,"replies":217},"flag":"公司自述","story":{"id":"2109697260573319190","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2109697260573319190"}},{"title":"用 AI 自动给公司做视频，融了1000万美元","summary":"AI 公司 Clueso 宣布融资 1000 万美元，帮公司自动做营销、客户教学和员工培训视频，已有 1000 多家机构在用。","post":{"id":"2110007145639072128","url":"https://x.com/realAkashAnand/status/2110007145639072128","author":"realAkashAnand","author_name":"Akash Anand","created_at":"2026-10-13T21:58+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":456732,"likes":1600,"reposts":172,"replies":247},"flag":"公司自述","story":{"id":"2110015126212632997","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110015126212632997"}},{"title":"新生意：专给 AI 智能体买保险","summary":"美国创业公司 Harbor 拿到 1000 万美元种子轮，专门给企业用的 AI 智能体上保险，比如 AI 胡编、出错造成的损失。AI 越能干活，“出错谁赔”就越是新需求。","post":{"id":"2110008231120765422","url":"https://x.com/jsantosaranda/status/2110008231120765422","author":"jsantosaranda","author_name":"Jesus","created_at":"2026-10-13T22:02+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":371481,"likes":914,"reposts":165,"replies":129},"flag":"公司自述","story":{"id":"2110018197999219054","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110018197999219054"}},{"title":"专给 AI 用的搜索引擎，年收入破1亿美元","summary":"AI 搜索公司 Exa 的老板说，公司年化收入超过 1 亿美元，三年来每年涨约 10 倍。他的判断：AI 智能体搜索的次数会远超人类，卖“给 AI 用的工具”是门生意。","post":{"id":"2110058915589464192","url":"https://x.com/WilliamBryk/status/2110058915589464192","author":"WilliamBryk","author_name":"Will Bryk","created_at":"2026-10-14T01:23+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":87933,"likes":950,"reposts":57,"replies":121},"flag":"公司自述","story":{"id":"2110071021680365916","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110071021680365916"}},{"title":"创业者 Jason Fried：赚了钱，大部分先揣进兜里","summary":"知名创业者 Jason Fried 回应“先盈利”的说法：同意要赚钱，但别把利润全投回自己公司，那是年年加倍押风险；先存起来，或者买指数基金。","post":{"id":"2109809564900376823","url":"https://x.com/jasonfried/status/2109809564900376823","author":"jasonfried","author_name":"Jason Fried","created_at":"2026-10-13T08:52+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":63118,"likes":555,"reposts":13,"replies":30},"flag":"观点","story":{"id":"2109813616136315176","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2109813616136315176"}}]},{"id":"grok","name":"Grok Bot 使用小技巧","icon":"🛠️","items":[{"title":"Grok、Cursor、X 会员合成一个订阅","summary":"官方宣布推出“X 订阅”，把 Grok、Cursor 和 X 会员合在一起。据 X 热点汇总，老用户可以保留原套餐，也可以换过去，几款产品共用每周额度。","post":{"id":"2109783335296008414","url":"https://x.com/SpaceXSI/status/2109783335296008414","author":"SpaceXSI","author_name":"SpaceX Super Intelligence","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:08+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":5013143,"likes":15969,"reposts":1813,"replies":1364},"flag":"据X热点汇总","story":{"id":"2109710211460297026","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2109710211460297026"}},{"title":"记忆搬家：把旧 AI 记住的东西搬进 Grok Bot","summary":"马斯克转发 Grok Bot 的“记忆搬家”功能。据 X 热点汇总，可以把 ChatGPT、Claude 里的记忆贴进来，一条条确认后导入，不用从零教它。","post":{"id":"2109867516646637579","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2109867516646637579","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-13T12:43+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":4261627,"likes":6655,"reposts":684,"replies":770},"flag":"据X热点汇总","story":{"id":"2109768964343476636","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2109768964343476636"}},{"title":"马斯克：Bot 帮我选购乐高，到货后自己停了查物流","summary":"马斯克说，Grok Bot 帮他研究并买了乐高，到货后 Bot 自动停止查物流。用法参考：让它下单后盯物流，送到就自动收尾。","post":{"id":"2110138164811833534","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2110138164811833534","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-14T06:38+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":684193,"likes":3420,"reposts":299,"replies":644}},{"title":"让 Bot 帮你认出诈骗邮件","summary":"马斯克转发：有人公开邮箱每天收到诈骗邮件，越来越难分辨，就让 Grok Bot 帮着识别。可以把可疑邮件交给 Bot 先看一遍。","post":{"id":"2110125937551397151","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2110125937551397151","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-14T05:50+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":674553,"likes":2131,"reposts":294,"replies":470}},{"title":"有人做了“讲解视频 Bot”，看不懂就让它做视频","summary":"马斯克转发了一个用法：有人做了个“讲解视频 Bot”，任何看不懂的话题，让它做一段视频来讲解。","post":{"id":"2110123302777995538","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2110123302777995538","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-14T05:39+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":669194,"likes":1517,"reposts":206,"replies":260}},{"title":"每个 Bot 都能有自己的邮箱，还能帮你理邮件","summary":"马斯克转发 0.70.2 版更新：每个 Bot 可以领一个自己的邮箱地址，帮你起草邮件（你确认后才发），还能帮你分析、总结收件箱。","post"