分员工，理由是“小团队做得更多更好”，称新团队三周已上线 30 多个功能。不少人批评说法冷血。","post":{"id":"2109713695165329511","url":"https://x.com/fedesimio/status/2109713695165329511","author":"fedesimio","author_name":"Federico Simionato","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:31+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":2926230,"likes":3161,"reposts":137,"replies":944},"flag":"有争议","story":{"id":"2109765892733325397","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2109765892733325397"}},{"title":"美国超市巨头克罗格：三年裁掉3000个办公室岗位","summary":"据报道，美国连锁超市克罗格计划三年内裁约 3000 个总部岗位，约占总部员工 37%。据 X 热点汇总，同时会扩大用 AI 提效。","post":{"id":"2109787526508749096","url":"https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2109787526508749096","author":"unusual_whales","author_name":"unusual_whales","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:25+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":598894,"likes":5301,"reposts":475,"replies":217},"flag":"媒体报道","story":{"id":"2109775017282330704","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2109775017282330704"}},{"title":"机器人拿普通铁锹铲雪","summary":"美国 Reflex Robotics 公司在测试一台机器人，用普通铁锹在室外铲雪，目标是做现实中的体力活。视频在 X 上很火。","post":{"id":"2110057794309402684","url":"https://x.com/sciencegirl/status/2110057794309402684","author":"sciencegirl","author_name":"Science girl","created_at":"2026-10-14T01:19+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":88119,"likes":1454,"reposts":216,"replies":178},"story":{"id":"2110115209574588612","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110115209574588612"}},{"title":"Shopify 老板：给你的 AI 装个“购物技能”","summary":"网店平台 Shopify 老板发布“购物技能”：给现有的 AI 智能体装上、连上 Shop 账号，就能帮你搜商品、下单、查物流。","post":{"id":"2110091896156803526","url":"https://x.com/tobi/status/2110091896156803526","author":"tobi","author_name":"tobi lutke","created_at":"2026-10-14T03:34+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":71990,"likes":753,"reposts":45,"replies":54},"flag":"公司自述","story":{"id":"2110048868679426519","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110048868679426519"}},{"title":"机器人大模型开放接口：摘草莓、装服务器","summary":"机器人 AI 公司 Physical Intelligence 开放接口测试版，企业能拿自己的机器人数据去调教模型，合作案例从摘草莓到组装服务器。","post":{"id":"2110115571681690051","url":"https://x.com/physical_int/status/2110115571681690